    ["Fire a continuous stream of phantom energy missiles at the target from medium range."] = "Выпустите непрерывный поток ракет фантомной энергии по цели со средней дистанции.",
    ["Why does it have to be me who encounters this kind of thing? Am I really that unlucky?"] = "Почему именно я должен сталкиваться с подобными вещами? Неужели мне так не повезло?",
    ["Dominator's Clash City Ranking Title Rewards"] = "Награды за рейтинговые титулы в Dominator's Clash City",
    ["乌黯魔狼对自己许愿，给所有玩家添加<Disable>暗光</>效果，暗光会持续对玩家造成伤害并逐渐夺去玩家的光明。"] = "Темный Демонический Волк загадывает желание, добавляя эффект <Disable>Dark Light</> всем игрокам. Dark Light будет постоянно наносить урон игрокам и постепенно лишать их света.",
    ["That's fine too."] = "Это тоже нормально.",
    ["Dear Beyonder: \n We have noted that you have already provided us with valuable suggestions regarding the game experience survey through another identity you hold. As promised, the thank-you gift for this time will be delivered directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World messenger. Please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey 4</>\n If you wish to leave your opinions again using your current identity, you may continue to pass your thoughts through the hidden channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your spirituality guide your path forward."] = "Dear Потусторонний: \n We have noted that you have already provided us with valuable suggestions regarding the game experience survey through another identity you hold. As promised, the thank-you gift for this time will be delivered directly to your mailbox by a Spirit World messenger. Please check it. \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey 4</>\n If you wish to leave your opinions again using your current identity, you may continue to pass your thoughts through the hidden channel in the email. We always welcome your suggestions. \n Thank you for witnessing this journey. May your Духовность guide your path forward.",
    ["Elegant Gentleman"] = "Элегантный джентльмен",
